description: Thinkigen final database change gate
globs: ["database/**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

# FINAL GATE

Before saying "done", confirm:

[ ] I inspected existing implementation.
[ ] I understood the exact requested change.
[ ] I changed only required objects.
[ ] I did not invent a business rule.
[ ] I checked PK/FK/UNIQUE/CHECK.
[ ] I checked datatypes/nullability.
[ ] I checked delete/history impact.
[ ] I checked security/scope.
[ ] I checked index/performance impact.
[ ] I checked FastAPI compatibility.
[ ] I created a migration if schema changed.
[ ] I did not edit an applied migration.
[ ] I added/updated tests.
[ ] I considered rollback/recovery.
[ ] I did not hardcode secrets.
[ ] I did not create procedures/triggers/jobs without approval.
[ ] I can explain every changed line/object.

If any answer is NO or UNKNOWN:
STOP and resolve it before completion.
